  (text "NOTES:"
    (at 12.70 248.92 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.524 1.524)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "a0e0b7c8-2989-4f37-aac7-9ef5259a1773")
  )
  (text "1. E73 normal-voltage mode: VDD=VDDH=+3V3; DCCH floats (LDO, no DCDC inductor)."
    (at 12.70 255.27 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "89eabe38-d468-4e0c-9b8e-cdbc84fc6023")
  )
  (text "2. P0.18=nRESET via UICR PSELRESET (FW); APX809 MCU_RST + tact + SWD-10 share net."
    (at 12.70 260.35 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "e09134fc-6e9f-4ddb-90af-0efa10e461cd")
  )
  (text "3. DFU: hold BOOT (P1.11 low) + tap RESET; UF2 double-tap RESET also enters bootloader."
    (at 12.70 265.43 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "045c09e4-107c-4a67-a53f-a138dd8653be")
  )
  (text "4. Unused nRF GPIOs P1.10/P0.26/P0.06/P0.08 + NFC P0.09/P0.10: NC on schematic,"
    (at 12.70 270.51 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "a2e1e63b-7e3e-45ad-904f-78e640b75847")
  )
  (text "   FW configures input-with-pull, never hard-tied (ELEC-020). Antenna keepout under E73 end (layout)."
    (at 12.70 274.32 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "aec30d60-5e15-44f6-a2bf-33937c088946")
  )
  (text "5. Plain crossings (no dot) unconnected by design: (227,140) (268,97) (262,163)."
    (at 12.70 275.59 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "908132da-1ec7-4907-8f73-dadb19c75d42")
  )
  (text "6. Y201 CL=9pF; C201/C202=12pF provisional, trim at bench. E73 footprint by layout job."
    (at 12.70 280.67 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "756bd5f6-8103-43c3-a415-43ac0148511d")
  )
